        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>健康生活方式 - 更年期健康知识可视化</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    background: #f2efe9;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f2efe9;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1px 1fr;\n    gap: 0 25px;\n    padding: 10px;\n  }\n  .divider {\n    background: #1a1a1a;\n    width: 1px;\n  }\n  .left-col, .right-col {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 18px;\n  }\n  .header-right {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a;\n    padding-bottom: 6px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .section-title .dots {\n    color: #d92b3c;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n  .dotline {\n    color: #d92b3c;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    margin: 2px 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  p.body-text {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .icon-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 8px 0;\n  }\n  .icon-item {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 4px;\n  }\n  .icon-box {\n    width: 44px;\n    height: 44px;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 20px;\n  }\n  .icon-label {\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n  .stat-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .stat-item {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 4px;\n  }\n  .stat-icon {\n    font-size: 26px;\n  }\n  .stat-value {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .weight-block {\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n  .bmi-bar-wrap {\n    margin: 10px 0;\n  }\n  .bmi-bar {\n    height: 16px;\n    width: 100%;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#333,#333 3px,#555 3px,#555 6px);\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .bmi-bar .highlight {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 30%;\n    width: 25%;\n    top: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    background: #d92b3c;\n  }\n  .bmi-labels {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .bmi-caption {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    color: #444;\n  }\n  .formula-text {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    margin: 8px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .scale-placeholder {\n    width: 90px;\n    height: 60px;\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    margin: 6px 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  .small-note {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .icon-row4 {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr);\n    gap: 8px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n  /* right column */\n  .chart-placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 260px;\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    background: repeating-radial-gradient(circle at 60% 40%, #f7f2ea, #f7f2ea 20px, #efe6d8 20px, #efe6d8 40px);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #555;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    position: relative;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .food-labels {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .food-item {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 4px 8px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    background: #fff;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: fit-content;\n  }\n  .food-item .amt {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .principle-list {\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    margin: 6px 0 0 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .principle-list p {\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .title-block {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .title-block h1 {\n    font-size: 34px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .title-block .subtitle {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a;\n    padding-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    background: #fff;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->\n  <div class=\"left-col\">\n\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"dots\">■</span>运动健身</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"section-title\" style=\"font-size:12px;\">运动的益处</div>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">适宜的运动有益健康，可以提高机体脂肪的供能比例，可以改善脂质代谢，对维持正常血压、降低血清胆固醇水平、提高心肺功能都有积极作用，还可以改善人体心理状态，有助于消除疲劳。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"section-title\" style=\"font-size:12px;\">推荐运动</div>\n      <div class=\"icon-grid\">\n        <div class=\"icon-item\"><div class=\"icon-box\">🚲</div><div class=\"icon-label\">自行车</div></div>\n        <div class=\"icon-item\"><div class=\"icon-box\">🏊</div><div class=\"icon-label\">游泳</div></div>\n        <div class=\"icon-item\"><div class=\"icon-box\">🏃</div><div class=\"icon-label\">慢跑</div></div>\n        <div class=\"icon-item\"><div class=\"icon-box\">💃</div><div class=\"icon-label\">广场舞</div></div>\n        <div class=\"icon-item\"><div class=\"icon-box\">🧘</div><div class=\"icon-label\">瑜伽</div></div>\n        <div class=\"icon-item\"><div class=\"icon-box\">🥋</div><div class=\"icon-label\">太极</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">更年期妇女在运动锻炼中应尽量避免骨关节-肌肉-骨骼系统的伤，合理进行有氧运动，条件合适可以选做力肌肉力量锻炼。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"section-title\" style=\"font-size:12px;\">推荐运动量</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-row\">\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <div class=\"stat-icon\">👣</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-value\">6000步</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <div class=\"stat-icon\">❤️</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-value\">150次/min</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:100%;height:40px;margin-top:8px;\">\n        锻炼最佳方式为每周至少3次<br>最佳时长为30min/次<br>每周进阶度25 &#8211; 3次肌肉训练\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"dots\">■</span>维持体重</div>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">随着年龄的增长，人体的基础代谢率降低，此外，雌激素分泌的减少将进一步降低女性的基础代谢率，40&#8211;49岁时可能降低5%，50&#8211;59岁时可能降低10%，从而使热量摄入没有得到有效相应下降而导致脂肪的持续积累，维持正常的重量对于更年期女性很重要。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"bmi-bar-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"bmi-bar\"><div class=\"highlight\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"bmi-labels\"><span>18.5</span><span>23.9</span></div>\n        <div class=\"bmi-caption\">更年期女性建议BMI</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"formula-text\">计算公式：BMI=体重/身高的平方(国际单位kg/㎥)</div>\n\n      <div class=\"scale-placeholder\">[图标: 体重秤]</div>\n\n      <p class=\"small-note\">肥胖的女性体重若减轻5%&#8211;10%，就能有效改善与肥胖相关的多种病症的发生。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"dots\">■</span>其他</div>\n      <div class=\"icon-row4\">\n        <div class=\"icon-item\"><div class=\"icon-box\">😴</div><div class=\"icon-label\">足量睡眠</div></div>\n        <div class=\"icon-item\"><div class=\"icon-box\">🚫</div><div class=\"icon-label\">注意避孕</div></div>\n        <div class=\"icon-item\"><div class=\"icon-box\">🚬</div><div class=\"icon-label\">戒烟</div></div>\n        <div class=\"icon-item\"><div class=\"icon-box\">🍷</div><div class=\"icon-label\">戒酒</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n  <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->\n  <div class=\"right-col\">\n\n    <div class=\"header-right\">更年期健康知识可视化</div>\n\n    <div style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start;\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n        <div class=\"chart-placeholder\">[图表: 饮食结构圆形图，分区标注谷类/蔬菜/水果/奶/动物性食物，中心为苹果与多种食物图案]</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"food-labels\">\n      <div class=\"food-item\">谷类<span class=\"amt\">每天250&#8211;400g&nbsp;&nbsp;粗粮与杂豆50&#8211;150g</span></div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\">蔬菜<span class=\"amt\">每天300&#8211;500g</span></div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\">水果<span class=\"amt\">每天200&#8211;400g</span></div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\">奶<span class=\"amt\">每天300g</span></div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\">动物性食物<span class=\"amt\">每天120&#8211;200g</span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"dots\">■</span>基本原则</div>\n      <div class=\"principle-list\">\n        <p>控制总能量在1800&#8211;1900千卡，饮食适量均衡饮食，该年龄段年轻妇女可适当减少能量。</p>\n        <p>限制脂肪，控制过多脂肪的摄入，避免摄入油炸、油炸的食物。</p>\n        <p>充足重合白物，选择低脂乳制品、瘦肉、豆制品、鱼类等。</p>\n        <p>调整膜内水化合物来源比例，多选择富含膳食纤维的全谷类、蔬菜、低糖水类。</p>\n        <p>定时定量、细嚼慢咽、拒绝压力性进食或者焦虑期用食缓解</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"title-block\">\n      <h1>健康<br>生活方式</h1>\n      <div class=\"subtitle\">了解更年期有益健康的生活习惯</div>\n      <p class=\"body-text\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">根据更年期身体特点培养有益的生活习惯，倡导整体的、预防为先的保健理念，帮助妇女减少更年期相关不良事件及疾病的发生，促进身心健康。</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
